    {
      "id": "PA-C220-ne-return",
      "sequence": 12040,
      "title": "Return to the small marker",
      "headword": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤਾ · ਖ਼ਰੀਦਣਾ",
      "romanization": "Aman ne kamm kītā · kharīdṇā",
      "gloss": "retrieve the familiar Aman did the work and to buy by ear",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:afaf2a4ce1e5ada3",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "Aman ne kamm kītā",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *Aman ne kamm kītā*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤਾ, \"Aman did the work\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "After a name, the doer of a past like ਕੀਤਾ takes the small marker ਨੇ. After ਮੈਂ it takes nothing: ਮੈਂ ਚਾਹ ਪੀਤੀ. Hold one more verb ready: ਖ਼ਰੀਦਣਾ, \"to buy\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "Aman did the work",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *Aman did the work*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤਾ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "I drank tea",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *I drank tea*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਮੈਂ ਚਾਹ ਪੀਤੀ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "to buy",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *to buy*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਖ਼ਰੀਦਣਾ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Where does ਨੇ go? (Right after the named doer.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PA-C220-aman-ne",
      "sequence": 12050,
      "title": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ — Aman bought a book",
      "headword": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ।",
      "romanization": "Aman ne kitāb kharīdī.",
      "gloss": "Aman bought a book: name + ਨੇ, the verb agreeing with the thing",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "sight",
      "derivedModality": "sight",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "eyes-or-hands-step"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:e96788e763ddaf2f",
      "notice": {
        "modality": "sight",
        "needs": [
          "your eyes or your hands for the steps that ask you to read, point, write or gesture"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Guided Practice"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your eyes, so it is not fully a driving lesson. You will want your eyes or your hands for the steps that ask you to read, point, write or gesture. You can listen to everything else now. I will say so again when we reach it, but leave this section until you have stopped: Guided Practice."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say Aman did the work. Then to buy and a book."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: ਨੇ beyond the work",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The marker works with any verb that is done to something. The past still agrees with the thing: ਕਿਤਾਬ is feminine, so ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ। — Aman ne kitāb kharīdī. — Aman bought a book."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਚਾਹ ਪੀਤੀ। — Aman ne chāh pītī. — Aman drank tea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਸੇਬ ਖਾਧਾ। — Aman ne seb khādhā. — Aman ate an apple."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Going and coming are not done to anything, so they take no ਨੇ: ਅਮਨ ਘਰ ਗਿਆ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "Aman ate a roti",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *Aman ate a roti*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਰੋਟੀ ਖਾਧੀ।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "Aman went to school",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *Aman went to school*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਅਮਨ ਸਕੂਲ ਗਿਆ।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ। (Aman ne kitāb kharīdī.)",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: **ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ।**]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Point to ਨੇ, then to the thing the ending agrees with."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "WRITE",
              "instruction": "copy ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ। (Aman ne kitāb kharīdī.) once",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU WRITE: copy **ਅਮਨ ਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਖ਼ਰੀਦੀ।** once]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Does ਅਮਨ ਘਰ ਗਿਆ take ਨੇ? (No: going is not done to anything.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
